# agentfront — instructions for AI agents

> A published catalog of businesses that AI agents can compare and query. There is no vector search; filter with the MCP tool `search_businesses`.

- Base URL: {{ base }}
- Agent instructions: {{ base }}/agents.md
- Business catalog: {{ base }}/llms.txt
- JSON feed: {{ base }}/feed.json
- Sitemap: {{ base }}/sitemap.xml
- UCP profile: {{ base }}/.well-known/ucp
- MCP endpoint (Streamable HTTP): {{ base }}/mcp

## Published businesses

{% for business in businesses %}
- [{{ business.name }}]({{ business.agents_md_url }}): {{ business.summary }}
  - HTML: {{ business.html_url }}
  - Markdown: {{ business.md_url }}
  - UCP profile: {{ business.ucp_url }}
  {% if business.service_area %}- Service area: {{ business.service_area | join(", ") }}
  {% endif %}
  {% if business.tags %}- Tags: {{ business.tags | join(", ") }}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## Human authorization

Any commitment — purchase, contract, booking, or sending personal data — requires the human buyer's explicit authorization. The agent MUST confirm the details with the human and obtain approval before submitting a conversion, placing an order, or entering a binding agreement.
